  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **War Begun** (2 other sources): Audio fades out after Anytime during crowd noise and returns at the start of War Begun, where the recording was split [1][2]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **All Night Long**: rare: 4 archived performances [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **mmj2012-12-29.dpa4023_24bit** (recommended): source not stated; 22 songs; 145 min [1]\n- **mmj2012-12-29.dpa4023_16bit**: source not stated; 22 songs; 145 min [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **mmj2012-12-29.dpa4023_24bit**: taped by John Lynch; transferred by Andy Murray; source: DPA 4023>Lunatec V3>AD2K>Tascam HD-P2(24bit/48khz) [1]\n- **mmj2012-12-29.dpa4023_16bit**: taped by John Lynch; transferred by Andy Murray; source: DPA 4023>Lunatec V3>AD2K>Tascam HD-P2(24bit/48khz) [2]. Also: Transfer chain: WAV to USB to MacBook Pro, edited in Wave Editor with iZotope resampling and dither to 16-bit/44.1k, then FLAC8 via XAct [2]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by Status Serigraph Previous: [My Morning Jacket Live Archive - 2012-12-29 Capitol Theatre - Port Chester, NY](https://archive.mymorningjacket.net/index.php/shows/2012/2012-12-29-capitol-theatre-port-chester-ny) [4]",
